 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The first conjugation",
   "texto": [
    "Many regular verbs of frequent use end up in **-ать** in the infinitive: **делать** (do), **работать** (work), **читать** (read).",
    "In the regular verbs of this pattern, **-ть** is removed and these endings are added: **-ю, -ешь, -ет, -ем, -ете, -ют**.",
    "The first conjugation also has **-у/-ут** variants, such as **живу/живут**; some verbs change the root.",
    "In Russian, the subject pronoun is usually expressed. In third person singular, **он**, **она** and **оно** use the same verbal form: **делает**."
   ]
  },
